  "description": {
   "en": "Thriller about a pessimistic man hitting 30 who accepted a high-paying illegal job. He \u0026 another thug are asked to rob a bag from an old lady. But what should have been an easy gig suddenly turns into chaos when the old woman shoots his accomplice in the head. The man manages to flee with the bag but when he opens it he can't believe his eyes: its the severed head of the current prime minister of Japan. But how? Isn't the prime minister speaking on TV right now?!\n\n(from Manga MoguraRE)"
